Z||000000||LoW_KeY||12-26-2001||07:29 PM||||Anyone got know the 3.4 bore size of the camaro engine? I need to know this to have custom pistons made for her, thanks!<P>-KC||||reg||1
Z||000001||00lE||12-28-2001||06:14 AM||||Well, no one else answered this so I guess I will.<BR>The stock 3.4 bore is 92mm.<BR>I have heard that many choose the 3.4 dohc pistons to increase cr a bit, and that may be a more appealing option than the $600 you would pay for a custom set.  If your intentions are to decrease the cr for a boosted application on the 3.4, I would look into a set of stock 3400 sfi pistons.||||reg||1
Z||000002||lou_dias||12-28-2001||09:32 AM||||3.62" even though a true 3.4 is 3.64"||||reg||1
